#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:1
msgid "Huangpu"
msgstr "黄浦区"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:4
msgid "Fintech, clinical services, design and consumer applications"
msgstr "金融科技、临床服务、设计与消费应用"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:6
msgid ""
"The 2025-2026 Zhangjiang Huangpu Park plan emphasizes fintech and "
"clinical research services. Huangpu ChuangKa is a separate youth "
"entrepreneurship support route; check eligibility and current workstation "
"availability."
msgstr "2025至2026年张江黄浦园方案侧重金融科技与临床研究服务。黄浦创卡是另行实施的青年创业支持渠道，须核验资格与当前工位情况。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S068 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-qtqj2/20250928/01633cced4e24e7b95ef1fa870b2aacd.html>`_. "
"黄浦区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区黄浦园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S068 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-qtqj2/20250928/01633cced4e24e7b95ef1fa870b2aacd.html>`_. 黄浦区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区黄浦园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:10
msgid "Who receives the inquiry"
msgstr "咨询受理"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:13
msgid "Huangpu science and entrepreneurship services"
msgstr "黄浦区科技与创业服务部门"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:15
msgid "`Official district website <https://www.shhuangpu.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`区政府官网 <https://www.shhuangpu.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:17
msgid ""
"A current direct program phone or email is not established in this "
"record. Use the official website to request the named receiving team."
msgstr "本记录未核实现行项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官网索取具体受理团队。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:19
msgid "Before applying"
msgstr "申请之前"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:22
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:24
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:26
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:28
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:30
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:32
msgid ""
"Ask which current notice governs the project, whether registration and "
"actual operations must both be in the district, which expenditure period "
"is eligible, and whether previous municipal or district awards exclude a "
"claim. Obtain the answer before moving a company or incurring costs."
msgstr "询问适用的现行通知、注册与经营是否均须属地、可计入支出期间，以及已获市区资助是否影响申报。应在迁移企业或发生费用之前获得答复。"

#: ../../districts/huangpu.rst:34
msgid "Local organizations in this atlas"
msgstr "本图谱中的本区机构"

